## _Previous_Year — Prior-Year Comparison Bases

**Billed Revenue PY ($)**
`CALCULATE([Total Billed Revenue ($)], DATEADD('Date'[Date], -1, YEAR))`
Shifts Total Billed Revenue back one year to establish a prior-year comparison baseline.

**Denied Revenue PY ($)**
`CALCULATE([Money At Risk], DATEADD('Date'[Date], -1, YEAR))`
Shifts Money At Risk back one year to establish a prior-year comparison baseline.

**Net Recovery PY ($)**
`CALCULATE([Net Recovery ($)], DATEADD('Date'[Date], -1, YEAR))`
Shifts Net Recovery back one year to establish a prior-year comparison baseline.

**Denial Rate PY**
`CALCULATE([Denial Rate %], DATEADD('Date'[Date], -1, YEAR))`
Shifts Denial Rate % back one year to establish a prior-year comparison baseline.

**Paid Revenue PY ($)**
`CALCULATE([Total Paid Revenue ($)], DATEADD('Date'[Date], -1, YEAR))`
Shifts Total Paid Revenue back one year to establish a prior-year comparison baseline.

**Pending Revenue PY ($)**
`CALCULATE([Total Pending Revenue ($)], DATEADD('Date'[Date], -1, YEAR))`
Shifts Total Pending Revenue back one year to establish a prior-year comparison baseline.

