## _Comparisons — Formatted YoY % Change Labels

**Billed Amount vs PY**
`VAR billedamount = DIVIDE([Total Billed Revenue ($)] - [Billed Revenue PY ($)], [Billed Revenue PY ($)], 0) RETURN IF(billedamount > 0, "▲ " & FORMAT(...) & " vs PY", "▼ " & FORMAT(...) & " vs PY")`
Builds a formatted "▲/▼ X% vs PY" text label showing year-over-year change in billed revenue.

Denied Amount vs PY**
`VAR deniedamount = DIVIDE([Money At Risk] - [Denied Revenue PY ($)], [Denied Revenue PY ($)], 0) RETURN IF(...)`
Builds a formatted "▲/▼ X% vs PY" text label showing year-over-year change in denied (at-risk) revenue.

**Denied Rate vs PY**
`VAR deniedrate = DIVIDE([Denial Rate %] - [Denial Rate PY], [Denial Rate PY], 0) RETURN IF(...)`
Builds a formatted "▲/▼ X% vs PY" text label showing year-over-year change in the denial rate.

**Net Recovery vs PY**
`VAR netrecovery = DIVIDE([Net Recovery ($)] - [Net Recovery PY ($)], [Net Recovery PY ($)], 0) RETURN IF(...)`
Builds a formatted "▲/▼ X% vs PY" text label showing year-over-year change in net recovery.

**Paid Amount vs PY**
`VAR paidamount = DIVIDE([Total Paid Revenue ($)] - [Paid Revenue PY ($)], [Paid Revenue PY ($)], 0) RETURN IF(...)`
Builds a formatted "▲/▼ X% vs PY" text label showing year-over-year change in paid revenue.

**Pending Amount vs PY**
`VAR pendingamount = DIVIDE([Total Pending Revenue ($)] - [Pending Revenue PY ($)], [Pending Revenue PY ($)], 0) RETURN IF(...)`
Builds a formatted "▲/▼ X% vs PY" text label showing year-over-year change in pending revenue.

